NAME: follow-ups-weekly
OWNER: follow-ups
KIND: active
WHERE: jesse-pc
WHEN: Every Friday at 7:53 AM (NZ time)
CRON: 53 7 * * 5
CRON_TZ: Pacific/Auckland (local time on Jesse's PC)
SKILLS: follow-ups-report
MILESTONE: M2
STATUS: Created paused. Switched on only after Jesse says yes.
---
Switch check: read state/routines-on.md. If "follow-ups-weekly" isn't listed as "on" or "test", log SKIPPED_OFF and stop.
Test mode: if listed as "test", mark the report TEST.
Stop check: if state/STOP exists, log SKIPPED_STOPPED and stop.
Isolation guard: work only in this workspace. If context/owner.md is missing, log NO_CLIENT_SOURCE and stop.
Lean run: read only this week's GoHighLevel conversations and new contacts.
Run log: append to runs/<YYYY-MM>/<date>-follow-ups-weekly.md: EXECUTED + one-line result, or FAILED + reason, and Sources read.

Run skills/follow-ups-report/SKILL.md (charter: agents/06-follow-ups.md), read-only. Write data/follow-ups-report.md: new leads by source, follow-ups sent and their status (delivered, opened, replied), and who to call. List the report in queue/needs-jesse.md.
